"\n"
"{url}\n"
"\n"
"Po kliknięciu w link poczekaj na potwierdzenie od organizatora."
msgstr ""
"To confirm your registration for the Christmas Eve Secret Santa, click the link:\n"
"\n"
"{url}\n"
"\n"
"After clicking it, wait for the organiser to approve your account."

